#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:2
msgid "ResNet：高原反应补给站"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:4
msgid "高原反应补给站——越深越缺氧，跳跃连接让梯度跳过中间层，直接\"呼吸\"到浅层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{doc}`inception` 用多尺度工具赢得了 ImageNet 2014——22 层。很自然的想法：堆更深，比如 50 层、100 "
"层，会不会更好？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:8
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`receptive-field` 中讨论过：层数越多，感受野越大，每个神经元能捕获的上下文越丰富。理论上，100 层应该比 22 "
"层更强。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:10
msgid "但现实很骨感——**退化问题**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:176
msgid "网络深度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
msgid "训练集准确率"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
msgid "测试集准确率"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:176
msgid "20层"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
msgid "85%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
msgid "82%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:176
msgid "56层"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
msgid "75%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md
msgid "70%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:17
msgid ""
"**更深反而更差！** "
"而且这**不是过拟合**——注意训练集准确率也在下降。过拟合的特征是训练好但测试差，而这里训练本身就已经崩了。这种现象被称为**退化问题**：随着网络深度增加，准确率饱和后迅速下降，且无法通过更多训练迭代解决。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"直到 2015 年，ResNet {cite}`he2016deep` 的出现才解决了这个难题，它用 152 层网络赢得了 ImageNet "
"竞赛，证明了\"深\"确实可以\"更好\"。更惊人的是，他们在 CIFAR-10 上成功训练了 **1000 "
"层**的网络——这在之前是完全不可想象的。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:21
msgid "深层网络的困境"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid "回顾 {ref}`gradient-vanishing` 中讨论的问题：梯度是各层影响的**乘积**。在深层网络中，这个乘积链太长了。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:25
msgid "假设每层梯度都是 0.9（已经不错了），100层连乘后："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:27
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"0.9^{100} \\approx 0.0000266\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:31
msgid "这意味着靠近输入层的参数几乎收不到梯度信号——前面几十层\"冻住\"了，只有后面几层在更新。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:33
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{ref}`sigmoid-gradient-vanish` 中提到 Sigmoid 会加剧这个问题，但即使换成 "
"ReLU，单纯堆叠层数仍然会遇到优化困难。问题的本质是：**网络需要学习一个复杂的映射函数，但梯度传播的路径太长太曲折**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:35
msgid "方法一：几何视角——建立\"抄近路\"通道"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:37
msgid ""
"想象一个传话游戏：100 "
"个人排成一列，第一个人说一句话，传到最后一个人时，信息已经严重失真了。深层网络就像这个游戏——输入信号经过几十层变换后，梯度信号\"传\"不回前面的层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:39
msgid "ResNet的核心洞察很简单：**如果某一层学不到有用的东西，不如让它\"抄近路\"，把输入原封不动地传过去**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:45
msgid ""
"**左图（ResNet 基础模块）**：输入 $\\mathbf{x}$ 通过残差路径后与恒等映射相加得到输出 "
"$\\tilde{\\mathbf{x}}$。曲线箭头即为跳跃连接，让梯度可以直接回传。这是本节的核心结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:47
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**右图（SE-ResNet 模块）**：在残差连接基础上增加了 Squeeze-and-Excitation "
"分支，用于学习通道注意力——自动判断\"哪些特征通道更重要\"。这是{doc}`se-net`的内容，展示了 ResNet 架构的扩展性。图片来自"
" SE-Net 论文 {cite}`hu2018squeeze`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:50
msgid "**关键区别**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:52
msgid "**普通网络**：梯度必须一层一层地\"传\"，每传一层就衰减一点"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:53
msgid "**残差网络**：梯度可以通过\"捷径\"直接回传到前面的层，绕过了中间的衰减"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:55
msgid "这就像爬山：普通网络只能沿着山路蜿蜒而上，残差网络则允许你直接坐缆车从山顶滑到山脚。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:57
msgid "方法二：信息论视角——只学\"差异\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:59
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"从{doc}`互信息<../model-architecture-"
"design/part1-intro>`的角度看，深层网络面临一个**信息瓶颈**问题：数据每经过一层，都可能丢失一些原始输入的信息。100 "
"层之后，网络可能已经\"忘记\"了输入到底是什么。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:61
msgid ""
"ResNet 的解决方案很巧妙：**与其让网络学完整的映射 $H(x)$，不如让它学\"需要改什么\"——即残差 $F(x) = H(x) - "
"x$**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:63
msgid "用生活场景类比："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:65
msgid "**普通网络**：老师让你\"画一只猫\"，你只能凭空想象猫长什么样"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:66
msgid "**残差网络**：老师给你一张狗的图片，让你\"改成一只猫\"——你只需要画\"猫和狗的不同之处\"（耳朵、尾巴、胡须）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:68
msgid ""
"显然，后者的任务更简单。同样，让网络学 $F(x)$（残差）比学 $H(x)$（完整映射）更容易——如果输入和输出已经很接近，$F(x) "
"\\approx 0$ 即可。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:70
msgid "恒等映射：两种视角的数学统一"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:72
msgid "现在我们用数学语言统一上述两种视角。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:74
msgid "**恒等映射**（Identity Mapping）指的是：输入 $x$ 原封不动地作为输出。数学上就是 $f(x) = x$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:76
msgid "普通网络的层学习目标："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:78
msgid ""
"\n"
"y = H(x)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:82
msgid "ResNet的层学习目标："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:84
msgid ""
"\n"
"y = F(x) + x\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:88
msgid "其中 $F(x)$ 是残差函数，$x$ 通过**跳跃连接**（Skip Connection）直接加到输出上。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:90
msgid "**核心优势**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:92
msgid "**梯度传播**：反向传播时，梯度可以通过恒等映射的x分支直接回传，不受 $F(x)$ 的影响"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:93
msgid "**优化容易**：如果某一层不需要做任何变换，让 $F(x)=0$ 即可恢复恒等映射，网络总能\"退回到\"较简单的状态"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:95
msgid "梯度流动的数学原理"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:97
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"为什么跳跃连接能解决梯度消失？回顾 {doc}`../../math-fundamentals/back-propagation` "
"中的分析：深层网络的梯度等于多层 {ref}`jacobian-matrix` 的连乘，当每层 Jacobian 的奇异值 $< 1$ "
"时，梯度会指数级衰减（详见 {ref}`gradient-vanishing-math`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:99
msgid "ResNet 的核心突破在于为梯度提供了**第二条路径**："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:101
msgid "**ResNet 的梯度传播**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:103
#, python-brace-format
msgid "残差块：$h_{i+1} = h_i + F(h_i, W_i)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:105
msgid "反向传播时："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:107
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_i} = \\frac{\\partial "
"\\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_{i+1}} \\cdot \\frac{\\partial "
"h_{i+1}}{\\partial h_i} = \\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial "
"h_{i+1}} \\cdot \\left(1 + \\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial h_i}\\right)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:109
msgid "**关键洞察**：梯度分成两条路径"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:111
msgid ""
"**跳跃路径**：$\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_{i+1}} \\cdot 1 = "
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_{i+1}}$（直接回传，不衰减！）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:112
msgid ""
"**残差路径**：$\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_{i+1}} \\cdot "
"\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial h_i}$（可能衰减，但不影响主路径）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:114
msgid "对于 $n$ 个残差块的堆叠："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:116
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_i} = \\frac{\\partial "
"\\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_n} \\prod_{k=i}^{n-1} \\left(1 + "
"\\frac{\\partial F_k}{\\partial h_k}\\right)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:118
msgid "展开前几项："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:120
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\prod_{k=i}^{n-1} (1 + a_k) = 1 + \\sum a_k + \\sum_{k \\neq j} a_k a_j "
"+ \\ldots"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:122
#, python-brace-format
msgid "其中 $a_k = \\frac{\\partial F_k}{\\partial h_k}$。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:124
msgid "**保底机制**：即使所有 $a_k \\approx 0$（残差分支没学到东西），梯度依然可以通过："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:126
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial \\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_i} \\approx \\frac{\\partial "
"\\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_n} \\cdot 1 = \\frac{\\partial "
"\\mathcal{L}}{\\partial h_n}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:128
msgid "这就是 $+1$ 的魔力——梯度至少为 1，不会衰减到零。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:130
msgid "**数值验证**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
msgid "注意"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:135
msgid "以下为假设每层梯度因子 = 0.9 的数值模拟，用于直观对比数量级差异——并非实测数据。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:138
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"假设残差函数的梯度 $\\frac{\\partial F}{\\partial h} \\sim \\mathcal{N}(0, "
"0.01)$（均值为0，方差0.01）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
msgid "普通网络梯度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
msgid "ResNet 梯度"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
msgid "改善倍数"
msgstr ""

