msgid "6.7%"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
msgid "**ResNet-152**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
msgid "**2015**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
msgid "**152**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:132
msgid "**3.57%**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:158
msgid ""
"ResNet-152的 3.57% 是**模型ensemble**的结果，单模型约为 "
"4.5%。但即便如此，这也是前所未有的突破。更重要的是，ResNet 不仅在 ImageNet "
"分类任务夺冠，还在检测、定位、分割等任务中横扫所有对手——证明了残差架构的普适价值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/cnn-expedition/image-net-era/res-net.md:160
msgid "**152层**——这是此前认为\"不可能训练\"的深度。ResNet 不仅证明了深层网络可以训练，还证明了\"深\"是提升性能的关键。"
